## BACKEND PATTERNS

### Layer responsibilities
```
Controller  → HTTP only. Thin (<10 lines/method). Delegates to Service. Returns ResponseEntity<DTO>.
Service     → ALL business rules. @Transactional. Throws domain exceptions (not HTTP exceptions).
Repository  → JPA/persistence only. No logic. Extend JpaRepository<Entity, ID>.
```

### Package root: `com.himotech.laundryms`
Key packages: api/, orders/, payments/, rates/, reports/, auth/, users/, customers/, auditlog/

### Exception types (GlobalExceptionHandler maps to HTTP status)
- `NotFoundException` → 404
- `IllegalArgumentException` → 400
- `IllegalStateException` → 400
- `DuplicateResourceException` → 409
- `AccessDeniedException` → 403

### Test pattern
```java
@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)
class OrderServiceTest {
    @Mock ServiceRateService serviceRateService;
    @InjectMocks OrderService orderService;
    
    @BeforeEach void setUp() {
        // ALWAYS use getActiveRate() — never getByName() — for test mocks
        when(serviceRateService.getActiveRate()).thenReturn(testRate());
    }
}
```

### CI command (must pass before any push)
```bash
cd backend && ./mvnw -B -ntp verify
```

---

## FRONTEND PATTERNS

### Directory structure (key paths)
```
src/app/(auth)/           → login page
src/app/(dashboard)/      → all auth-required pages
src/app/(public)/track/   → public order tracking (no auth)
src/components/features/  → module components (orders/, payments/, dashboard/, etc.)
src/components/ui/        → shared atoms (Button, Modal, KPICard, StatusBadge, etc.)
src/constants/ui/         → ALL UI strings (index.ts → UI_LABELS)
src/hooks/                → useOrders, usePayments, usePriceCalculation, etc.
src/services/             → API layer (fetch + credentials: "include")
src/types/api.generated.ts → AUTO-GENERATED — never edit manually
src/types/components.ts   → manually maintained component prop types
```

### API call pattern (services/)
```typescript
// fetch with HTTP-only cookie auth
const result = await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL}/v1/orders`, {
  credentials: "include",
  headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
});
```

### Data fetching pattern (hooks/)
```typescript
"use client";
export function useOrders(params?: OrderListParams) {
  return useQuery({ queryKey: ["orders", params], queryFn: () => ordersService.list(params) });
}
```

### Form pattern
```typescript
"use client";
const form = useForm<FormData>({ resolver: zodResolver(schema) });
// Schema must be in src/lib/validators.ts — not inline in component
```

### Toast pattern
```typescript
import { toast } from "sonner";
toast.success(UI_LABELS.feedback.success.SAVED);  // always use UI_LABELS
toast.error(UI_LABELS.feedback.error.GENERIC);
```

### CI simulation (run before every push)
```bash
cd frontend && npm run lint && npm run typecheck && npm run build
```

