## DESIGN SYSTEM (FRONT-001 v3.3)

### Brand Colors (logo.svg source: #15489d only)
| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| brand-blue | #15489d | Primary CTA, active nav, folding badge — 8.59:1 on white ✅ |
| brand-cyan-dark | #1a7fa8 | Links, interactive icons on WHITE bg only — 4.61:1 ✅ |
| brand-cyan | #30a8d4 | Decorative/background ONLY — 2.74:1 ❌ fails text use |
| neutral-50 | #f8fafc | Page background (not pure white — reduces eye strain) |
| neutral-100 | #f1f5f9 | Cards, sidebar background |
| emerald-100/700 | #d1fae5/#047857 | Ready for Pickup (active urgency) |
| emerald-50/slate-500 | muted | RELEASED/Claimed (terminal — distinct from READY) |
| amber-100/700 | #fef3c7/#b45309 | Drying, warnings |
| rose-700 | #be123c | Danger/destructive ONLY — never overuse (alert fatigue) |

**60-30-10 Rule:** neutral-50 (60% backgrounds) → neutral-100 (30% cards) → brand-blue (10% CTAs/accents)

### Status Badge → ORDER_STATUS_META (in constants/order-status.ts)
NEVER hardcode badge colors inline. Always use ORDER_STATUS_META[status].
Every badge MUST have: bgClass + textClass + icon + label (WCAG 1.4.1 — not color alone)

### Semantic metaphors (match real world — Nielsen H2)
- RECEIVED → "Queued" (slate-200/slate-600)
- WASHING → "Washing" (light-cyan/brand-cyan-dark) — evokes water
- DRYING → "Drying" (amber-100/amber-700) — evokes heat
- FOLDING → "Folding" (blue-100/blue-700) — near completion
- READY_FOR_PICKUP → "Ready for Pickup" (emerald-100/emerald-700) — URGENT
- RELEASED → "Claimed" (emerald-50/slate-500) — MUTED terminal
- CANCELLED → "Cancelled" (rose-50/rose-700)

### Typography
- Headings: Plus Jakarta Sans (800w display, 700w H1, 600w H2/H3)
- Body/Data: Inter (14px standard, 13px small)
- Order IDs/Timestamps: JetBrains Mono 12px (disambiguates 0/O, 1/l)

### Spacing: 8px grid — only multiples of 4/8 (Tailwind: p-1=4px, p-2=8px, p-4=16px, p-6=24px, p-8=32px)

### Component variants (single component, variant prop — never separate files)
```tsx
<Button variant="primary|action|secondary|danger|ghost|outline" />
<Card variant="default|glass|glass-light|accent" />
```

### Glass utilities (defined in globals.css — never recreate inline)
- `.glass` → rgba(255,255,255,0.75) + blur(24px) + saturate(180%)
- `.glass-light` → rgba(255,255,255,0.2) + blur(8px)

### Animations
- Hover/focus transitions: 150ms
- Modal/drawer entry: 300ms
- Easing: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) (Material Design standard)
- Pulse (Ready for Pickup, Active Cycles): 1.8s ease-out infinite
- MUST: `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` disables all non-essential animations

### Touch targets: minimum 44×44px for all interactive elements (WCAG 2.5.5)

### Z-Index scale (strict)
- 0: page content / Kanban cards
- 100: sidebar
- 200: dropdowns
- 300: modals
- 400: toasts (Sonner)

