## ACCESS CONTROL

| Role | Allowed |
|------|---------|
| ADMIN | Everything + Reports, Rates, Users, Audit Logs |
| STAFF | Orders, Payments, Customers, Notifications |
| Public | /track only (reference number lookup — limited data) |

NEVER expose to public tracking: internal IDs, staff names, financial details, full customer profiles.

